    {
      "id": "s3",
      "part": 3,
      "label": "Part 3",
      "instruction": "Talk together with your partner about the situation.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q3",
          "number": 3,
          "points": 20,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i2",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img2"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Talk with your partner about the different things a new library could have, and decide which would be most popular with teenagers."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Now, in this part of the test you’re going to talk about something together for about two minutes. I’m going to describe a situation to you. A new library is going to open in a town. Here are some things the library could have. Talk together about the different things the library could have and say which would be most popular with teenagers. All right? Now, talk together.",
                "role": "examiner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t2-s-q3-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 27.7
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Shall I start? I think a games room with table tennis and chess would be great. Teenagers could meet their friends there. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t2-s-q3-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 8.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "That’s true. What about the computers? Lots of teenagers need them for their homework. Do you agree?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t2-s-q3-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "I’m not sure about the shop with pens and pencils. You can buy those things in lots of places. What’s your opinion?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t2-s-q3-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.7
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "What about the café outside, or the room for watching films? Which one do you think teenagers would like more?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t2-s-q3-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "So, which thing would be most popular with teenagers? I think the games room, because it’s fun. Do you agree?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/pet2/pet2-t2-s-q3-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.8
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
